{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 5780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 2480, "text": "You better run or you'll be on the\nbusiness end of that cocking gun."}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 8000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 6120, "text": "You want to stop me running? She's lost\nher mind."}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 11800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 8460, "text": "What's the problem, Kent? I just need\nthree hours to replace the floor in the"}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 14320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 11800, "text": "guard's lounge, but I can't do it until\nthey leave."}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 16720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 14920, "text": "I like the lounge the way it is."}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 22020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 17760, "text": "Sir, without the guard's lounge, we\nbailiffs had no place to cut loose and"}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 23020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 22020, "text": "recreate."}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 27760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 24980, "text": "And Roz can be quite surly when she\ncan't recreate."}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 33200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 30520, "text": "So I guess she won't be her usual\neffervescent self?"}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 37600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 35000, "text": "I guess you won't eat the rest of your\nmeals through a straw."}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 41560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 40160, "text": "Harry, this is serious."}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 45320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 42240, "text": "All right, I'll tell you what, guys. You\ncan use my office as a temporary"}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 46920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 45320, "text": "bailiff's lounge. How does that sound?"}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 49040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 47540, "text": "Very Solomon -like, Your Honor."}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 51840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 50440, "text": "I don't like it, but okay."}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 60010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 55490, "text": "Uh, boss, you wanted to see me? Yes, the\nbirds are using my car for target"}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 64550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 60010, "text": "practice again. Oh, Don, that metallic\nfinish is like a pigeon magnet."}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 69150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 65870, "text": "So, I want you to go stand by my parking\nspace and act like a scarecrow."}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 72930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 70070, "text": "Dan, last time you made Phil do that, he\ngot arrested for loitering."}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 76030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 73150, "text": "Yeah, well, no one's going to accuse him\nof loitering this time."}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 78330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 77330, "text": "Oh."}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 123540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 122280, "text": "Okay, Mac, batter up."}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 127860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 123820, "text": "Yes, sir. People versus Ohlmeyer.\nBreaking and entering and burglary."}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 133260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 128800, "text": "Mr. Prosecutor? Yes, sir. The Depends\nDesperado here."}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 136480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 134880, "text": "Broken to a private residence."}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 141080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 137120, "text": "And he attempted to make off with an\noriginal Diamore painting valued at over"}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 142080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 141080, "text": "$200 ,000."}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 143540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 142540, "text": "Whoa."}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 146300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 144780, "text": "She must be priced by the pound."}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 152030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 150180, "text": "Depends. Yes, Your Honor, Mr."}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 155210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 152250, "text": "Allmire and his wife recently lost their\nentire nest egg when their local"}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 156210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 155210, "text": "savings and loan failed."}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 160590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 156450, "text": "So he entered the home of the bank\npresident to make a withdrawal of sorts."}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 164610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 161850, "text": "I'm sorry, Mr. Allmire, but that's not\nthe way it works."}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 168970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 164990, "text": "Well, you tell me how it works. The bank\nfails. They tell me my money's"}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 173410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 168970, "text": "uninsured. I lost $110 ,000, my life\nsavings."}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 178390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 174270, "text": "You should do what I do. I keep all my\nmoney in a shoebox hidden underneath the"}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 180270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 178390, "text": "bed where nobody knows it is."}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 184370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 183370, "text": "Oops."}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 187250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 184530, "text": "Oh, now I'm going to have to hide it."}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 190170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 187850, "text": "I know. I'll put it underneath the\nchair."}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 193070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 192070, "text": "Oops."}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 195430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 193690, "text": "That's quite enough, Miss Hochheiser."}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 199110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 196350, "text": "Mac, why don't you see what you can find\nout about this? I'm on it, sir."}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 203720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 201280, "text": "Oh, there's my little girl."}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 209240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 204760, "text": "Excuse me, sir. You're fondling the\nstate's evidence."}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 213640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 209460, "text": "Oh, I've come to take her home. Oh, see,\nRoscoe Kittredge, your honor, president"}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 218400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 213640, "text": "and owner of Rockville Savings, and this\npainting belongs to me. It belongs to"}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 220460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 218400, "text": "all of us who lost our money in his\nbank."}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 223920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 220720, "text": "Sir, this painting happens to be a bank\ninvestment."}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 226440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 224380, "text": "Then why was it hanging in your living\nroom?"}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 228140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 226700, "text": "Well, it had to hang somewhere."}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 231960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 229680, "text": "Hey, hey, hey, I'm a victim as well."}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 236220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 232260, "text": "Rockville Savings has just been seized\nby the government. I'm just as broke as"}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 237620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 236220, "text": "this man. I'm bankrupt."}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 240900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 238120, "text": "Excuse me, Your Honor, but there's an\nemergency call for Mr."}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 243380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 241160, "text": "Kittredge from his houseboy."}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 248460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 246540, "text": "You're bankrupt and you have a houseboy?"}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 252460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 248700, "text": "Well, bankruptcy means different things\nto different people."}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 258240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 254380, "text": "Uh -huh. Why don't we take a break while\nMr. Kittredge huddles with his..."}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 259459, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 258459, "text": "House boy."}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 263860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 261839, "text": "Um, uh, bad news, boss."}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 268960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 264220, "text": "I stood out by your car like you told\nme, but, uh, the bird still hit it"}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 269960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 268960, "text": "good."}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 274240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 270220, "text": "On the bright side, I sold enough\npencils for a car wash."}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 276220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 275220, "text": "Good."}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 279620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 277340, "text": "Now, go earn me a hot wax."}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 280920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 279920, "text": "Oh!"}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 283420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 282420, "text": "Overtime!"}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 286080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 284620, "text": "Excuse me, uh..."}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 288560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 286640, "text": "I'm sorry to hear about your case."}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 291640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 288920, "text": "I kept some of my assets in that bank,\ntoo."}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 294180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 292220, "text": "Yeah, that big ball of lint, right?"}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 296260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 295000, "text": "No, really, boss."}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 298660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 296800, "text": "I'm liquid in several places."}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 303440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 302440, "text": "I'm sure you are."}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 307260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 303900, "text": "If there's anything I can do to help\nout, just let me know."}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 310240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 307620, "text": "Well, you can start by getting off my\nfoot."}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 315420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 312620, "text": "The man has enough troubles without\nbeing hazed by the friends of the"}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 316420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 315420, "text": "Mission."}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 320620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 317320, "text": "Oh, your honor, I just got some very\ndisturbing news."}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 324140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 320980, "text": "A check of my collection has turned up\nanother missing painting."}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 326540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 324620, "text": "Gerstel's The Yellow Parasol."}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 328700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 326960, "text": "The Yellow Parasol?"}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 330440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 329020, "text": "Isn't that on display somewhere?"}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 336240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 330780, "text": "Yes, in my guest powder room. That is,\nuntil a certain old man got his wrinkled"}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 339420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 336240, "text": "mitts on it. Oh, wait a minute. There is\nno proof that my client was involved."}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 341160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 340160, "text": "I was."}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 344660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 343660, "text": "My client's confession?"}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 346680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 344760, "text": "And my wife broke in with me."}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 352740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 348020, "text": "She's holding your Gerstel at brush\npoint, and if we don't get our money"}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 357120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 352900, "text": "the yellow parasol is going to become\nthe polka dot parasol."}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 364040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 358460, "text": "You old fool, you can't just kidnap a\nmasterpiece. Great art belongs to the"}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 368040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 364040, "text": "masses. Oh, really? And exactly how many\nof these masses got to see it hanging"}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 369320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 368040, "text": "in your guest powder room?"}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 370800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 369580, "text": "Oh, we throw lots of parties."}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 372200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 371140, "text": "Oh, you do, do you really?"}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 377400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 373539, "text": "Okay, okay, that's a five, Miss\nSullivan. My offer."}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 396520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 394960, "text": "Sorry, folks, didn't mean to interrupt."}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 407580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 405200, "text": "I cannot tolerate blackmail in my\ncourtroom."}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 409060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 408060, "text": "Idaho."}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 416060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 412580, "text": "So I would suggest that you talk to Mr.\nOhlmeier and get him to bring that"}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 418780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 416060, "text": "painting back before he gets in over his\nhead."}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 420700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 419700, "text": "Boise."}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 426100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 423060, "text": "I'm sorry, sir, but there's more to this\ncase than the simple letter of the law."}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 427960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 426960, "text": "Rhode Island."}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": 432700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 429760, "text": "An old couple has lost their life\nsavings. Where else can they go to get"}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 434100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 432700, "text": "justice? Providence."}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 441260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 437200, "text": "I feel real bad about the old Myers,\ntoo, but that is out of my jurisdiction."}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 443100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 442100, "text": "Montana."}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": 446120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 444500, "text": "Well, if we can't help them, who will?"}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 448220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 446760, "text": "Helena. Who?"}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 450740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 449100, "text": "It's the capital of Montana, right?"}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 454240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 452780, "text": "We were playing for money."}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 457420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 456420, "text": "Sorry."}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 460280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 459220, "text": "Sorry, Spearmint."}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 466240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 463740, "text": "lounge is only for bailiffs and other\nofficial personnel."}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 473800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 472800, "text": "Experiment?"}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 475720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 474720, "text": "Groupies."}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 481460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 479000, "text": "Ah, Phil, my bigger extraordinaire."}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 483020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 481840, "text": "What did you get this time?"}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 487980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 486980, "text": "Decaf."}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 490520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 489520, "text": "Excuse me."}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 494020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 490600, "text": "Mr. Robinson? Yeah. I'm Edward Shoup, U\n.S. Office of Thrift Supervision."}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 497800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 494280, "text": "He's the fascist bank examiner who stole\nmy S andL."}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 499860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 498380, "text": "Rockville Savings failed last month."}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 501980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 500220, "text": "Government is still trying to liquidate\nits assets."}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 504780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 502200, "text": "You leech. Why don't you auction off my\nblood, too?"}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 506080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 505080, "text": "I can't."}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 507160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 506160, "text": "It's too cold."}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 513200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 509280, "text": "We checked on this Ohmeyer person you're\nholding. He's telling the truth. At one"}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 517220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 513200, "text": "time, he had bank bonds worth $111 ,000."}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 521270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 517950, "text": "Then Kittredge runs the bank into the\nground, and Allmire winds up with"}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 522510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 521450, "text": "I don't believe this."}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 525890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 523289, "text": "Pure Chinese silk. This is my favorite\npower time."}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 527450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 526110, "text": "I feel awful."}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 530170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 528530, "text": "I'll go earn you a new one."}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 534230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 532470, "text": "Excuse me."}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 535450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 534450, "text": "Sure."}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 539130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 538130, "text": "Gee, thanks."}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 545270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 540150, "text": "I was just wondering, what happens to\nthe people who had passbook accounts at"}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": 546650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 545270, "text": "Rockville? They're lucky."}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 550250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 547130, "text": "Passbook accounts are insured, up to\n$100 ,000. Only 100 grand?"}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 552330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 551330, "text": "Bummer."}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 554250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 552510, "text": "I sweat and I shave."}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 555850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 554850, "text": "For what?"}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 566410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 564750, "text": "Excuse me, Dan Fielding, DA's office."}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 572470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 567270, "text": "This is going to be a real long shot,\nbut do you by any chance have a Phil"}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 574010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 572470, "text": "Sanders on that list?"}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 576070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 574850, "text": "Sanders? Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah."}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 579390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 578390, "text": "Sanders. Sanders?"}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 581910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 579770, "text": "Philip Alphonse, yeah. Oh."}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 584670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 582690, "text": "Ooh. Lost his shirt."}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 587810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 585030, "text": "Had 3 .2 mil in Rockville when it went\nunder."}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 595090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 594090, "text": "Mil."}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 597330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 595330, "text": "As in millions."}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 599650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 598650, "text": "Yes."}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 601310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 600310, "text": "Phil? What?"}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 602970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 601670, "text": "No, no, no. That's impossible."}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 604470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 603330, "text": "Whoa, whoa, whoa. Hold on, Dan."}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 606690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 605690, "text": "Wasn't, uh..."}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 607870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 606810, "text": "Wasn't Phil the stockbroker?"}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 612670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 608370, "text": "Well, that was years ago. Believe me,\nthe only asset he has left is his life's"}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 613670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 612670, "text": "farm."}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 616570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 614690, "text": "Well, maybe not. I mean, I read about\nthis."}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 619290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 617050, "text": "It's called the Howard Hughes Syndrome."}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 623510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 620290, "text": "Successful businessman socks away every\ndime, then one day just drops out and"}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 624750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 623510, "text": "lives like a pauper."}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 628810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 626850, "text": "You're telling me Phil is loaded?"}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 633850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 629710, "text": "Well, he was. Of course, now all he's\ngot left is his insured 100 grand."}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 635490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 634490, "text": "Poor guy."}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 644790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 643790, "text": "Poor guy."}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 655090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 654090, "text": "Oh, Phil!"}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 657090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 656090, "text": "My good man."}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 663170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 657990, "text": "You know, I was just thinking, when's\nthe last time you did something fun?"}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 665070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 663270, "text": "Something just for you."}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 668650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 666450, "text": "November 6, 1977."}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 672360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 670760, "text": "I use the pay toilet."}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 677860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 674380, "text": "Ah, yes, we all have our special\nmemories, don't we, Philip?"}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 679860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 678860, "text": "Alphonse."}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 682520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 680720, "text": "How did you know my middle name, boy?"}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 691700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 685160, "text": "Oh, joy of your sake, you... You know,\nlet's make today special."}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 693040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 692040, "text": "Here, ten bucks."}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 695580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 693180, "text": "Go do something just for yourself."}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 699080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 696520, "text": "Gee, it's awfully generous, boy."}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 700980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 699900, "text": "That's what friends are for."}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 702580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 701200, "text": "I give to you."}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 705120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 703440, "text": "You give to me."}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 712640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 706520, "text": "Remember that. And also remember, Dan is\nyour friend."}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 715320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 713700, "text": "Whatever you say, boss."}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 720920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 719920, "text": "Dan."}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 723240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 722240, "text": "Dan."}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 730040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 729040, "text": "Something else I was just thinking."}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 733480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 730580, "text": "When's the last time we had lunch\ntogether?"}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 736840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 734600, "text": "Does me licking your plate count?"}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 738540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 737540, "text": "Get that."}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 742060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 740300, "text": "How does the Russian tea room sound?"}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 747740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 743340, "text": "I imagine lots of clinking of glasses\nand sipping noises."}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 754500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 749600, "text": "That's not... That's not what I meant.\nListen, why don't we have lunch there?"}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 755880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 754880, "text": "Really?"}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 758100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 756920, "text": "I'm touch book."}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 760440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 759440, "text": "The hand."}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 765220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 760720, "text": "Right. Listen, first, I have to go\nchange this tie. So, I'll meet you"}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 766300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 765280, "text": "It's right next to Carnegie Hall."}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 769900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 766780, "text": "Do we really have to eat near Carnegie\nHall?"}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 771400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 770400, "text": "Why not?"}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 775840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 771800, "text": "It's just that I have this deep -rooted\nfear of musical instruments."}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 779300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 777720, "text": "You're afraid of musical instruments?"}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 781020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 780020, "text": "Isn't everyone?"}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 784300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 783300, "text": "Absolutely."}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 788140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 784820, "text": "You know what? And I think it's time we\nconfronted it together."}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 789780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 788780, "text": "Pal of mine."}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 791120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 790080, "text": "Russian tea room."}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 798680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 791760, "text": "One hour. Okay. You know, Dan, I always\nknew deep down inside that there"}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 800780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 798680, "text": "was something really special about you."}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 805380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 801540, "text": "I'm glad I'm your lackey. Me too. Got to\ngo. Oh,"}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 812560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 808320, "text": "excuse me. Can I talk to you for a\nsecond?"}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 818120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 814660, "text": "And this is a drunken disorderly who..."}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 819760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 818600, "text": "Finish this community service."}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 828180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 827180, "text": "You missed one."}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 830340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 829340, "text": "Thanks."}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 833700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 831800, "text": "Ooh, that was a good one."}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 839360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 837180, "text": "I'm sorry, sir. I can't concentrate with\nall this."}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 840600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 839600, "text": "Yeah."}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 843540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 842540, "text": "All right."}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 844539, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 843740, "text": "That's it."}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 845940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 844540, "text": "You all got to get out of here."}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 847900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 846680, "text": "Come on, everybody."}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 849540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 848540, "text": "Time to go."}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 854800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 853280, "text": "Okay, Harry, we can take a hint."}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 857140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 855480, "text": "It's not like we have nothing better to\ndo."}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 861040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 858380, "text": "Come on, guys, let's go take turns\nsitting on the shoeshine stand."}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 863760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 862420, "text": "Come on, come on, hustle, hustle."}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 865420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 864140, "text": "Out of here, out of here, out of here."}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 867240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 866240, "text": "Come on."}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 869040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 867680, "text": "I'll take that, thank you."}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 875960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 874960, "text": "Hey,"}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 878000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 876980, "text": "how was lunch?"}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 882190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 881070, "text": "Why so glum, Dan?"}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 884230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 882770, "text": "Did he let you pick up the check?"}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 888590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 885770, "text": "No, and from now on, you should be\ncareful what you say about Phil Sanders."}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 890570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 888990, "text": "Oh, why? Because he's suddenly rich?"}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 892170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 891170, "text": "No."}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 893610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 892470, "text": "Because he's suddenly dead."}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 898750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 897750, "text": "Dan,"}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 905630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 904250, "text": "I don't believe it. Phil's dead?"}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 906870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 905870, "text": "What happened?"}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 908450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 907090, "text": "It was a piano accident."}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 912630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 911630, "text": "A what?"}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 913950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 912670, "text": "In front of Carnegie Hall."}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 918570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 914670, "text": "They were hoisting a baby grand up to\nthe second floor just as Phil was"}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 921530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 918570, "text": "under. The rope snapped and boom."}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 923670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 922430, "text": "The key was sharp."}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 925070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 924030, "text": "Phil was flat."}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 930090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 928830, "text": "What a way to go."}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 932010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 930530, "text": "Oh, poor man."}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 935550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 932490, "text": "What about me? I had to identify the\nstain."}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 941300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 938880, "text": "Sorry, Dan. I know that you and Phil\nwere very close."}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 943900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 941860, "text": "You know, it was his one phobia."}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 949460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 946020, "text": "The man lived in fear of musical\ninstruments."}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 953240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 951640, "text": "Talk about irony."}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 955680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 954380, "text": "I fed him to his death."}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 959380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 956240, "text": "Oh, come on, Dan. We know you're upset,\nbut you can't blame yourself."}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 960979, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 960020, "text": "Christine's right."}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 962120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 960980, "text": "These things just happen."}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 966560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 965180, "text": "Well, not often."}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 970280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 969280, "text": "Hardly ever."}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 976040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 972200, "text": "One time they do, it's because it was\nmeant to be."}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 978380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 976980, "text": "I've got to put this in perspective."}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 979699, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 978700, "text": "Of course you do."}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 984000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 979700, "text": "It's not my fault Phil died. That's more\nlike it, Dan. It's just my dumb luck."}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 988200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 984700, "text": "The moment I find out Phil's loaded, he\nkicks the bucket. Dan Fielding gets"}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 989260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 988200, "text": "chipped once again."}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 994620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 991060, "text": "Gee, Dan, your grief seems to be getting\nthe better of you."}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 997959, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 997040, "text": "I'm shocked."}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 1000980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 997960, "text": "Phil was a living, breathing human\nbeing, and you were closer to him than"}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 1002840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1000980, "text": "anyone. Surely that must mean something\nto you."}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 1007180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1006020, "text": "I think I see your point."}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 1011140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1008080, "text": "Oh, God, how stupid and short -sighted\nof me."}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 1014920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1011620, "text": "Phil has an estate and no relatives, so\nthat probably means I'm in line for some"}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 1015920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1014920, "text": "cash after all."}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 1017920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1016920, "text": "Thank you, Christine."}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 1021100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1019560, "text": "God bless you."}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 1025859, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1023660, "text": "This is boring."}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 1028740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1026599, "text": "I miss doing nothing in the guard's\nlounge."}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 1035339, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1029980, "text": "People, there's more to life than just\nvegetating in some drab lounge."}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 1037400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1036400, "text": "Like what?"}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 1042220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1038440, "text": "Exercise, read a novel, write a letter."}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 1045079, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1042680, "text": "Your wise man never wastes his free\ntime."}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 1049900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1045880, "text": "Remember, free time is the most precious\nthing we have."}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 1051960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1050920, "text": "Jack, that's..."}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 1058370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1055830, "text": "Floor's done. The guard's lounge is all\nyours."}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 1060170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1058870, "text": "Dibs on the folding chair!"}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 1069970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1064490, "text": "Mr. Allmire, I am truly sorry about your\nlife savings, but I'm afraid if you"}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": 1074810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1069970, "text": "don't tell us right now where your wife\nis hiding that stolen painting, you"}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": 1078270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1074810, "text": "could be looking at five to ten years in\nprison."}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": 1080290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1079290, "text": "Oh, dear."}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": 1086900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1081480, "text": "Well, Your Honor, I'm an old man, my\nwife's an old woman, and I guess we need"}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": 1088780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1086900, "text": "each other more than we need the money."}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": 1091680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1089300, "text": "Would Mr. Kittredge consider dropping\nthe charges?"}
{"cue": 301, "end_ms": 1094640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1092300, "text": "All I want is my painting back."}
{"cue": 302, "end_ms": 1099260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1095520, "text": "Oh, well... All right."}
{"cue": 303, "end_ms": 1110400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1105460, "text": "Then your wife really had nothing to do\nwith this? Well, actually, sir..."}
{"cue": 304, "end_ms": 1113040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1110860, "text": "She held the getaway bus for me."}
{"cue": 305, "end_ms": 1116580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1115580, "text": "Case dismissed."}
{"cue": 306, "end_ms": 1121320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1117140, "text": "Excuse me, Your Honor. Edward Choup. I'm\nwith the government. I was given this"}
{"cue": 307, "end_ms": 1122279, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1121320, "text": "earlier today."}
{"cue": 308, "end_ms": 1124080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1122280, "text": "It might be of some assistance to Mr.\nOhlmeier."}
{"cue": 309, "end_ms": 1129860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1128860, "text": "Wow!"}
{"cue": 310, "end_ms": 1137560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1130640, "text": "It's a check to Mr. Ohlmeier for $100\n,000 from Philip Alphonse"}
{"cue": 311, "end_ms": 1138560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1137560, "text": "Sanders."}
{"cue": 312, "end_ms": 1145790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1144210, "text": "What? My Phil?"}
{"cue": 313, "end_ms": 1147710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1146710, "text": "Is it any good?"}
{"cue": 314, "end_ms": 1148769, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1147990, "text": "Oh, yes."}
{"cue": 315, "end_ms": 1150090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1148770, "text": "Sanders had a hundred grand left."}
{"cue": 316, "end_ms": 1155610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1150430, "text": "He told me he felt badly about the\nO'Mayers, and he wanted them to have it."}
{"cue": 317, "end_ms": 1159730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1156930, "text": "Oh, this is fantastic."}
{"cue": 318, "end_ms": 1161970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1160510, "text": "Where can I find Mr."}
{"cue": 319, "end_ms": 1163190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1162190, "text": "Sanders?"}
{"cue": 320, "end_ms": 1165990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1163770, "text": "He has a spot in front of Carnegie Hall."}
{"cue": 321, "end_ms": 1171030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1168310, "text": "Oh, thank you, sir. Thank you."}
{"cue": 322, "end_ms": 1179970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1173350, "text": "Uh, Mr. Kittredge, when the government\nseized your SNL, weren't you supposed to"}
{"cue": 323, "end_ms": 1181070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1179970, "text": "turn over all the assets?"}
{"cue": 324, "end_ms": 1182370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1181370, "text": "What's your point?"}
{"cue": 325, "end_ms": 1185010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1183970, "text": "The paintings."}
{"cue": 326, "end_ms": 1187390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1185630, "text": "Oh, these."}
{"cue": 327, "end_ms": 1189730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1188030, "text": "Must have slipped my mind."}
{"cue": 328, "end_ms": 1192390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1191390, "text": "Thank you."}
{"cue": 329, "end_ms": 1206970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1201130, "text": "Come by your house tomorrow in case you\nhad any other memory lapses. I assume it"}
{"cue": 330, "end_ms": 1208270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1206970, "text": "is your house."}
{"cue": 331, "end_ms": 1210770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1209650, "text": "I hate you."}
{"cue": 332, "end_ms": 1222050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1219750, "text": "Oh, damn. His package came for you."}
{"cue": 333, "end_ms": 1224430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1223170, "text": "I hope it's not Phil."}
{"cue": 334, "end_ms": 1235390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1233070, "text": "Dear boss, sorry I ruined your power\ntie."}
{"cue": 335, "end_ms": 1239290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1235870, "text": "Saw this one on the way to lunch and\nthought of you. Love, Phil."}
{"cue": 336, "end_ms": 1248790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1247350, "text": "Figures. What do you mean?"}
{"cue": 337, "end_ms": 1251990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1249430, "text": "Phil's last act was to buy me a gift."}
{"cue": 338, "end_ms": 1253630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1252250, "text": "Yeah, that's really touching."}
{"cue": 339, "end_ms": 1257850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1253970, "text": "That's just typical of the dumb stunts\nhe was always pulling. That I even put"}
{"cue": 340, "end_ms": 1260010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1257850, "text": "with Phil is a tribute to my divine\npatience."}
{"cue": 341, "end_ms": 1263330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1261610, "text": "You're having a hard time with this,\naren't you?"}
{"cue": 342, "end_ms": 1268090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1265070, "text": "What is it with you people around here?\nWhy does everyone want me to break down"}
{"cue": 343, "end_ms": 1268969, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1268090, "text": "and cry?"}
{"cue": 344, "end_ms": 1270790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1268970, "text": "Because it'll make you feel better."}
{"cue": 345, "end_ms": 1272450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1271210, "text": "Christine, I'm fine."}
{"cue": 346, "end_ms": 1275410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1272850, "text": "The man did me a few errands. It's not\nlike I was his brother."}
{"cue": 347, "end_ms": 1278210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1276430, "text": "Okay, that's the way you feel about it."}
{"cue": 348, "end_ms": 1285250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1279490, "text": "Well, I will admit that losing Phil will\naffect me in certain ways. I mean, for"}
{"cue": 349, "end_ms": 1289870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1285250, "text": "instance, he always dropped off my dry\ncleaning, so at the moment I'm not sure"}
{"cue": 350, "end_ms": 1290870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1289870, "text": "where half my suits are."}
{"cue": 351, "end_ms": 1298700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1293420, "text": "If I wanted information on a woman I was\ndating, like a birth date or her name,"}
{"cue": 352, "end_ms": 1305740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1298980, "text": "I could always count on Phil. He was the\nbest house sitter, too, because he"}
{"cue": 353, "end_ms": 1306980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1305740, "text": "didn't mind sleeping in the sink."}
{"cue": 354, "end_ms": 1313560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1309440, "text": "So, what you're saying is that Phil's\npassing is just an inconvenience to you?"}
{"cue": 355, "end_ms": 1321680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1316140, "text": "No. I'm just saying that I don't have to\ncry to feel the loss."}
{"cue": 356, "end_ms": 1327290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1324850, "text": "Because my life is going to be a little\ndifferent every day."}
{"cue": 357, "end_ms": 1331410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1328030, "text": "And if you don't think that means\nanything to me, you're sadly mistaken."}
{"cue": 358, "end_ms": 1334030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1333030, "text": "I'm sorry, Dan."}
{"cue": 359, "end_ms": 1335730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1334410, "text": "I guess I misjudged you."}
{"cue": 360, "end_ms": 1337550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1336550, "text": "Join the crowd."}
{"cue": 361, "end_ms": 1348310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1344570, "text": "Well, Phil, it's not much to remember\nyou by, but I guess it'll have to do."}
{"cue": 362, "end_ms": 1353890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1352890, "text": "Still, I, um..."}
{"cue": 363, "end_ms": 1356650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1355210, "text": "I won't forget you, you bum."}
{"cue": 364, "end_ms": 1361250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1360090, "text": "Boy, life is cruel."}
{"cue": 365, "end_ms": 1365170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1361570, "text": "I mean, what purpose could be served by\nthe death of such a good soul?"}
{"cue": 366, "end_ms": 1368649, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1367690, "text": "Good night."}
{"cue": 367, "end_ms": 1369369, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1368650, "text": "Good night."}
{"cue": 368, "end_ms": 1374690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1369370, "text": "Oh, by the way, thought you might like\nto know, your friend who died, turns out"}
{"cue": 369, "end_ms": 1377050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1374690, "text": "he had accounts in half the banks of New\nYork."}
{"cue": 370, "end_ms": 1379870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1377670, "text": "He left an estate worth over $8 million."}
{"cue": 371, "end_ms": 1383070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1380710, "text": "Now, all goes to someone else."}
{"cue": 372, "end_ms": 1385040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1384040, "text": "Go figure."}
{"cue": 373, "end_ms": 1391160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1389920, "text": "That's the purpose."}
{"cue": 374, "end_ms": 1393960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1392880, "text": "Thank you."}
